            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Nwo 2.26–3.11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magi aye nyiŋ luker ma i lobo-nu ma jo Icrael guloyogi ci gumako lobogi ma i loka Jordan yo tuŋ wokceŋ, gucamo odoko megi, cakke wa i kulu Amon o kwede wa i got Kermon, kacel ki Araba ducu ma yo tuŋ potoceŋ: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "en aye Cikon kabaka pa jo Amor ma yam bedo i Kecbon kun loyo kwede lobo cakke wa i Aroer ma tye i dog nota me kulu Amon, dok cakke ki i dye nota-nu o kwede i kulu Jabok ma waŋ lobo pa jo Ammon, en aye nucu lobo Gilead; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kacel ki Araba o wa i nam me Kinerot tuŋ wokceŋ ki tuŋ yo mukemo Bet-jecimot o wa i nam me Araba, ma en aye nam me Kado, cito kwede wa i pwor got Piciga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka doki Og kabaka me Bacan, en aye ŋat acel ma yam odoŋ ki i kom jo Repaim, ma yam bedo i Acitarot ki i Edrei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En yam loyo got Kermon ki Caleka ki Bacan o kwede wa i waŋ lobo pa jo Gecur ki jo Maaka, ki nucu lobo Gilead o wa i waŋ lobo pa Cikon kabaka me Kecbon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 32.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 3.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses ma latic pa Rwot yam oloyogi kacel ki jo Icrael; ci Moses latic pa Rwot omiyo lobogi bot jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace obed megi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
